<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 262-6 V ENGLAND - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 262-6 V ENGLAND - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 262</p>
<p>for six, a lead of 335 runs, at close of play on the third day</p>
<p>of the third test against England at Old Trafford on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 and 262-6 (S.Waugh 82 not out),</p>
<p>England 162 (M.Butcher 51; S.Warne 6-48, G.McGrath 3-40).</p>
